%% Sequence: one memory run, started by the main agent's recall_memory call.
%% Each step writes the run state atom, and the pane redraws it.
%% Epic E1 only. The Haiku calls, the HTTP calls, and reflect follow contracts.md.
sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Main agent
    participant Run as Memory run
    participant Pane as Memory pane
    participant Haiku as Haiku model
    participant HS as Hindsight HTTP API

    Agent->>Run: Calls recall_memory with no input
    Run->>Pane: Opens pane memory-run, step query
    Run->>Haiku: Stored prompts and session end, 400 tokens
    Haiku-->>Run: Need line and Recall line
    Run->>Pane: Step search, Need and Recall shown

    par Recall
        Run->>HS: POST memories/recall, budget mid
        HS-->>Run: Records, 8 kept at most
    and Page search
        Run->>HS: GET knowledge-base/search, limit 5
        HS-->>Run: Page hits
    end

    Run->>Run: Drops this session records and Generating content pages
    Run->>Pane: Step questions, counts shown
    Run->>Haiku: Records and page snippets, 600 tokens
    Haiku-->>Run: Page id, Context line, 1 to 3 Reflect lines
    Run->>Pane: Step reflect, each question running

    par Page read
        Run->>HS: GET knowledge-base/pages/page id
        HS-->>Run: Body up to 6000 characters, timestamp
    and Reflect
        Run->>HS: POST reflect through curl, 170 s limit
        HS-->>Run: Answer for each question
    end

    Run->>Pane: Step done, answers shown
    Run-->>Agent: Judging rules, Need, records, page, answers
    Note over Run,Pane: A failed step writes its reason in its section
